  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evidence Based Policy and Global Instruments and Knowledge Products: Disseminating statistics and strengthening capacities on dietary data to guide policies and programmes (The Food and Diet Domain)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will allow the launch of an innovative domain within FAOSTAT for nutrition which will be accessible and available to all. This will address the gap in availability and accessibility of different types of statistics on dietary data to better inform policy, investments, and actions to transform food systems to enable healthy diets for all.</narrative>
  </description>
